        travel: "Jaipur city → Amber Fort, about 11 km, 30–40 minutes each way depending on traffic.",
        tip: "Buy the Jaipur composite monument ticket if you plan to see Amber, Jantar Mantar, Nahargarh and Hawa Mahal — it is valid across two days and pays for itself after about three sights.",
